<title>SPAIN: Repsol names four new board members.</title>
<headline>Repsol names four new board members.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish energy group Repsol said on Thursday it has named four new board members.</p>
<p>The nominations must be approved at the annual shareholders meeting on Friday, Repsol said in a statement.</p>
<p>The four, who will be external board members, are Gonzalo Anes, Ignacio Bayon Marine, Juan Antonio Garcia Diez and Antonio Hernandez-Gil Alvarez-Cienfuegos.</p>
<p>Repsol will have 16 board members, comprised of the chairman, eight external board members and seven institutional board members.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
